{"detail": {"templateUuid": "c4af385b015248cfa3dcdd3f74b265f7", "projectUuid": "ba1d97bdbdfc424a911f70f7525edc62", "name": "大明风华丨中式建筑美学风格", "description": "如果“大明风华”只能凝结成一个瞬间，我想它应该是这样的——\n日落前的朱墙、沉默的重檐、横斜的古松，以及一个几乎被宏大建筑吞没的人。\n画面以灰蓝、矿物朱红、松墨黑和少量暖金统一色调，再让纤细却有力量的解构狂草落入画面中心。宫墙的严整秩序，与书法笔势的自由失控彼此碰撞，最终留下庄严、孤寂又极具张力的东方观感。", "coverUrl": "/assets/280c4c9a631ef79a.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/4516157ad4cf4175bef2cb448d41b9f3/ace816de7865f5d64ea6b28585fa9eb3a12b2354.mp4", "snapshotId": 44253, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 1740662, "ownerUuid": "4516157ad4cf4175bef2cb448d41b9f3", "avatar": "/assets/40702f645561be10.webp", "nickname": "三千问Atelier", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 25, "tags": [{"id": 3057, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "一场戏的诞生 ", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3057/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 3059, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "2. 消失的TA", "parentTag": 3057, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3057/3059", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 1000, "code": "selected", "tagLabel": "精选画布", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1000/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 1202, "code": "style_aesthetic", "tagLabel": "风格美学", "parentTag": 1200, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1200/1202/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 2, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "userTags": [{"tagId": 5002, "name": "专业", "icon": "/assets/a31a6cc391430f72.webp", "primaryIcon": "/assets/7097b07d2df12cc8.webp", "desc": "LibTV专业作者", "verifyLevel": 2}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "47 【美学风格丨中式美学朱墙重檐建筑美学 - 三千问Atelier-美学分享 | 小红书 - 你的生活兴趣社区】 😆 QprwzBaLpwDiWxn 😆 https://www.xiaohongshu.com/discovery/item/6a9dd2df000000002802c7b4?source=webshare&xhsshare=pc_web&xsec_token=ABaZ8cRlun8Acq3JYxVcv1nDOBEpKJG553aDJmfSuMQaA=&xsec_source=pc_share", "createAt": "2026年09月08日 02:05", "updateAt": "2026年09月08日 02:22", "